{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>英國淨移民人數，在剔除新冠疫情期間的波動後，創近三十年新低。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.UK.IMMIGRANT-2300.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026L0ozmtAOEi1795704628.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>英國國家統計局公布的數據顯示，截至今年六月底的一年內，淨移民人數降至7.7萬，比先前一個年度的20.4萬，大跌逾五成，若果不計爆發新冠疫情的年份，7.7萬是自1997年以來最低年度數字。</p><p></p><p>局方表示這波下滑，主要由非歐盟公民移民減少所帶動。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.UK.IMMIGRANT-2300_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026SD7wt9RsGv1795704590.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>英國政府稱移民改革，讓英國重掌邊境管控主動權，構建更加公平合理的移民體系，優先吸納對英國社會經濟發展有實質貢獻的外籍人員。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T15:23:54.346913+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":212,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T12:32:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T20:17:32.283086+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T15:17:17.652296+00:00","content_hash":"c0f831b24577de9cec49c3135deb688805adc0bc0e3c62eececb4cf4d7f39ccc","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-26T15:23:54.346913+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}